{"job_id":"F-af8ad197bcd96f37fb30","family_id":"F-af8ad197bcd96f37fb30","title":"법원재난에 기인한 민형사사건 임시조치법","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001220-103864-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":21,"target_id":"a11af13b87054b2bfc0119b4ba04996038e6b04b06616a0acbdbee2073cd115e","source_hash":"c8edbc820ac723f7a7c3d0220d280332edfa3f6c2e0bed1c69daf7c04d46334b","text":"灾害引发的民事和刑事案件临时措施法"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001220-103864-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":98,"target_id":"c421600bd6ec852521cceb18ec36e9de5159a4298f0ef7b289cafb75909ae6f4","source_hash":"8caa6eecc9f4278954f38a09708261f172c6c8565f954ab4f2de4fc07315187a","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是制定临时措施，使法院能够在因火灾、内乱或其他灾害导致诉讼记录丢失的情况下，加快处理民事和刑事案件。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001220-103864-ko","scope":"BODY","start":98,"end":290,"target_id":"78b129dc919e1b6c9790da0bfa95747b799279bc964cd19a25ec31b786f6d6d3","source_hash":"9b7e36f812dcf334e7139da59b60e00db37fd757a1c7cd653c7b48ebc4c785b3","text":"第二条（措施程序）发生第一条所述灾害时，诉讼当事人和检察官应当在六个月内，按照下列各款规定向有关法院提起诉讼。\n1. 原告、申请人或上诉人：提交起诉状、申请书或上诉状的副本，以及证明案件仍在进行的材料\n2. 检察官：提交有关起诉书事实及其维护的材料\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001220-103864-ko","scope":"BODY","start":290,"end":397,"target_id":"4ec8cca44d805724b5db98119523bc7579a820d4afaeb3c6b4f5dcf5e659882d","source_hash":"f733588bb799ae7d38eb694975d4ac02cc30368b9ca5af6f70a57b7703ce2cc5","text":"第三条（撤回和撤销的推定）根据第二条提起诉讼的当事人或检察官，如未在相同期限内采取该条规定的程序，则诉讼、申请或上诉视为撤回，起诉书视为撤销。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001220-103864-ko","scope":"BODY","start":397,"end":513,"target_id":"e6e44182b62b90732bce68d8b8fce96681287989f881feaacd385663cb53c99a","source_hash":"3b154ec14e649807e65a0a7c2e520e5a12af6b26aa9cbd7a01cb4caec7ee62e1","text":"第四条（公告）如发生第一条所列灾害，有关法院的首席法官应当至少两次在对该法院有管辖权的地区法院所在地出版的日报上刊登，说明根据第二条提起诉讼的当事人应当提交的具体说明材料以及提交日期。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001220-103864-ko","scope":"BODY","start":513,"end":535,"target_id":"8373ec39609b11c8070f4e5391784da28516bbafe900f75aa499ed76998f9f8b","source_hash":"c97981562fcb9a533d2d6d1260bf53d1d6b95df1b4f4f38c638c902ef0638975","text":"补充条款 <第113号，1950年3月22日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001220-103864-ko","scope":"BODY","start":535,"end":557,"target_id":"6d584d5004dbb77a4b735898c93e15f0499ee73acad4c75135a38a7aa94359e1","source_hash":"0f2d41e905de38b74e2c6921b072c2d81632f74c1d0a1327589dd60e3ccb7bdd","text":"第五条 本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001220-103864-ko","scope":"BODY","start":557,"end":620,"target_id":"e28d1cf27560efe71b7230d558b2a577ccca97297cfbbe8774a46419dbf9fc59","source_hash":"250217fbcd7e6136f337e01fdae8efd21da0203abb207724b43cacf299ad2aba","text":"第六条 本法亦适用于本法实施前发生的法院灾难案件。但第二条规定的期限为自本法实施之日起四个月。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001220-103864-ko","scope":"BODY","start":620,"end":662,"target_id":"44146e6a0395160367e0043053d78b5c2f6786dcd6316a66cf32da20a0262f90","source_hash":"c7bd804c4db3596992d0df086806ac4495e5779fd43cca956df8e855e6845fda","text":"补充规定 <第10180号，2010年3月24日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。"}]}